{"seq":3,"slug":"saturation-errors","title":"饱和度与错误率：系统还能撑多久","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/core-metrics-map/request-metrics/saturation-errors","wordCount":2986,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"饱和度与错误率-系统还能撑多久\">饱和度与错误率：系统还能撑多久</h1><p>延迟告诉你「现在多快」，吞吐告诉你「现在多少」，但这两个数字都无法回答一个更紧迫的问题：还能撑多久。一个延迟 120ms、QPS 稳定在 4 万的服务，可能离崩溃只有 10% 的余量，也可能还有 3 倍空间——这两者的运营策略完全相反。区分它们靠的是饱和度（saturation），也就是「资源被用到了什么程度」。饱和度是所有警告性指标里最早发出信号的一个，因为它在资源耗尽之前就会让延迟开始非线性上升。本篇推导利用率与延迟的非线性关系，说明为什么饱和度必须在多个层次（CPU、内存、连接池、磁盘队列、下游配额）分别观测，并给出错误率与成功率的正确定义——包括降级逻辑如何污染可用性数字。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>饱和度指某个有限资源的占用比例。它的特殊之处在于<strong>与延迟的关系是非线性的</strong>，而且是单调加速的：占用率低时延迟几乎不变，超过某点后延迟急剧上升，且这个上升没有上限（因为队列长度没有上限）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>资源</th>\n<th>饱和度指标</th>\n<th>「安全」区间</th>\n<th>越界后的首要症状</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CPU</td>\n<td><code>cpu_utilization</code></td>\n<td>&lt; 60–70%</td>\n<td>调度延迟上升、GC 变慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存</td>\n<td><code>mem_used / mem_total</code></td>\n<td>&lt; 80%（含预留）</td>\n<td>换页、OOM Kill、缓存命中率崩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>磁盘 IO</td>\n<td><code>iowait</code>、<code>aqu-sz</code>（队列深度）</td>\n<td>队列深度 &lt; 1–2</td>\n<td>写延迟、fsync 抖动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络</td>\n<td>带宽占用、丢包率</td>\n<td>&lt; 70% 带宽</td>\n<td>重传、TCP 拥塞控制降速</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连接池</td>\n<td><code>pool_active / pool_max</code></td>\n<td>&lt; 70%</td>\n<td>获取连接超时、请求排队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线程池/工作队列</td>\n<td><code>queue_depth</code>、拒绝数</td>\n<td>拒绝数为 0</td>\n<td>请求被拒或排队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>下游配额</td>\n<td>已用配额 / 配额上限</td>\n<td>&lt; 80%</td>\n<td>被限流（429）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键观察：<strong>上表的每一行都是一个独立的饱和度，任何一个先耗尽都会成为瓶颈。</strong> 常见的误判是只看 CPU——CPU 50% 但连接池打满、磁盘队列深度 30 的系统，其实际饱和度远高于 50%，延迟已经在恶化。因此饱和度必须<strong>逐资源观测，并以「最接近上限的那一个」作为系统饱和度</strong>。这个「最紧的那个资源」在容量规划里被称为瓶颈资源。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[请求到达] --&gt; B[线程/进程池]&#10;    B --&gt; C[CPU 执行]&#10;    C --&gt; D[连接池&lt;br/&gt;取下游连接]&#10;    D --&gt; E[下游服务]&#10;    C --&gt; F[磁盘 IO]&#10;    F --&gt; G[fsync / 日志提交]&#10;    B --&gt; H[请求队列]&#10;    H --&gt;|队列满| I[拒绝: 503]&#10;    D --&gt;|池满等待| J[获取连接超时]&#10;    G --&gt;|IO 队列满| K[写延迟上升]&#10;    E --&gt;|429/超时| L[错误率上升]&#10;    I --&gt; M[客户端重试]&#10;    J --&gt; M&#10;    K --&gt; N[整体延迟上升]&#10;    L --&gt; O[降级逻辑触发]&#10;    M --&gt; A\">flowchart TD\n    A[请求到达] --&gt; B[线程/进程池]\n    B --&gt; C[CPU 执行]\n    C --&gt; D[连接池&lt;br/&gt;取下游连接]\n    D --&gt; E[下游服务]\n    C --&gt; F[磁盘 IO]\n    F --&gt; G[fsync / 日志提交]\n    B --&gt; H[请求队列]\n    H --&gt;|队列满| I[拒绝: 503]\n    D --&gt;|池满等待| J[获取连接超时]\n    G --&gt;|IO 队列满| K[写延迟上升]\n    E --&gt;|429/超时| L[错误率上升]\n    I --&gt; M[客户端重试]\n    J --&gt; M\n    K --&gt; N[整体延迟上升]\n    L --&gt; O[降级逻辑触发]\n    M --&gt; A</pre><p>上图里每一处「满」都会独立地产生症状，而它们之间还有耦合：磁盘 IO 队列满导致 CPU 在 iowait 上等待（表现为 CPU 利用率不高但吞吐下降），连接池满导致线程阻塞（表现为线程数正常但活跃线程全在等待）。这两类症状的共同特征是：<strong>CPU 空闲但系统变慢</strong>。这是饱和度故障的典型指纹，也是为什么单看 CPU 利用率会完全错过故障。</p>\n<h2 id=\"利用率的拐点-为什么-70-是常见的经验红线\">利用率的拐点：为什么 70% 是常见的经验红线</h2><p>利用率与延迟的关系可以用 M/M/1 排队模型量化。在这个模型下，平均排队时间与服务时间的关系是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>ρ</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ρ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ρ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_q = \\frac{\\rho}{1 - \\rho} \\cdot W_s, \\qquad W = W_q + W_s = \\frac{W_s}{1 - \\rho}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.988em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = \\lambda / \\lambda_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是利用率。把具体数字代入：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>利用率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>排队时间 / 服务时间</th>\n<th>总延迟 / 服务时间</th>\n<th>相比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = 0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0.3</td>\n<td>0.43</td>\n<td>1.43</td>\n<td>0.72x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.5</td>\n<td>1.00</td>\n<td>2.00</td>\n<td>1.00x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.7</td>\n<td>2.33</td>\n<td>3.33</td>\n<td>1.67x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.8</td>\n<td>4.00</td>\n<td>5.00</td>\n<td>2.50x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.9</td>\n<td>9.00</td>\n<td>10.00</td>\n<td>5.00x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.95</td>\n<td>19.00</td>\n<td>20.00</td>\n<td>10.00x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.99</td>\n<td>99.00</td>\n<td>100.00</td>\n<td>50.00x</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表是整个容量工程最重要的一张。它的读法是：<strong>从 50% 到 70%，吞吐提升 40%，延迟恶化 67%；从 80% 到 90%，吞吐提升 12.5%，延迟翻倍；从 90% 到 95%，吞吐提升 5.5%，延迟再翻倍。</strong> 因此在 80% 之后继续提高利用率是极端不划算的——收益趋零而风险陡增。这就是 70% 作为经验红线的来源：它留出了足够的余量来吸收突发流量，同时还没有进入延迟曲线的陡坡。</p>\n<p>三点必要的补充：</p>\n<p><strong>补充一：真实系统比 M/M/1 更好还是更差？</strong> M/M/1 假设到达过程是泊松、服务时间是指数分布、单服务器。真实系统往往有更多并发通道（相当于 M/M/c，拐点更缓），但服务时间常呈重尾分布（相当于 M/G/1，拐点更陡）。此外真实系统存在<strong>突发性</strong>（burstiness）：流量不是平滑的泊松过程，而是有明显的尖峰。突发流量会让瞬时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 远超平均 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span>，从而在平均利用率看起来只有 60% 时就已经进入陡坡。这就是为什么容量规划必须用峰值而非均值，并且需要留出比公式计算更多的余量。</p>\n<p><strong>补充二：利用率的分母口径。</strong> 「CPU 利用率 60%」在不同口径下差异极大：容器限额下的利用率（<code>container_cpu_usage / limit</code>）、节点上的利用率（<code>usage / node_capacity</code>）、以及应用视角的繁忙比例（<code>busy_time / wall_time</code>，不含 iowait）。容器化的系统里最常见的误判是<strong>只看节点 CPU 而忽略 cgroup 限额</strong>——节点 CPU 30% 而容器已经被 throttled 的情况完全正常，因为限额是按容器而非节点计。cgroup 的 <code>cpu.stat</code> 中 <code>nr_throttled</code> 与 <code>throttled_time</code> 才是容器视角的真实饱和度指标。这与 <a href=\"../cost-freshness-metrics/efficiency-metrics\">单位成本吞吐与资源利用率</a> 中讨论的资源利用率两种口径是同一问题的两面。</p>\n<p><strong>补充三：拐点位置与延迟目标绑定。</strong> 如果你的 SLO 是 p99 &lt; 200ms 而单请求服务时间是 50ms，那么可接受的排队倍数是 4 倍，对应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho \\approx 0.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6776em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span></span></span></span></span>。如果 SLO 是 p99 &lt; 100ms，可接受倍数是 2 倍，对应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho \\approx 0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6776em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span>。<strong>「利用率应该控制在多少」这个问题没有普适答案——它由延迟目标除以服务时间得到。</strong> 这也是为什么同样的系统在两家公司会有不同的红线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"错误率-成功率与可用性的正确定义\">错误率、成功率与可用性的正确定义</h2><p>错误率看似简单（失败请求 / 总请求），实际定义空间很大，且不同的定义会让同一个故障呈现出完全不同的严重程度。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>计入什么</th>\n<th>常见陷阱</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>请求错误率</td>\n<td>非 2xx（或非 2xx+3xx）/ 总请求</td>\n<td>协议层失败</td>\n<td>3xx 是否算成功取决于场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>业务错误率</td>\n<td>业务语义失败 / 总请求</td>\n<td>如「搜索无结果」「下单库存不足」</td>\n<td>与请求错误率完全解耦</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可用性 (availability)</td>\n<td>成功请求 / 有效请求</td>\n<td>通常排除 4xx（客户端问题）</td>\n<td>4xx 的归属可被操纵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成功率</td>\n<td>与可用性常互换使用</td>\n<td>口径不统一</td>\n<td>同名不同义，跨团队沟通失真</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三个必须明确的争议点。</p>\n<p><strong>争议一：4xx 是否算失败。</strong> 从 SLO 角度，客户端传错参数导致的 400 不应算服务端可用性损失——否则一个外部的错误调用脚本就能击穿你的 SLO。但 401/403 的激增往往意味着配置或鉴权故障（是服务端问题），而 429 明确是服务端限流（是服务端的容量决策）。把 429 排除在错误率之外是一种自欺：用户的请求确实没被服务。<strong>建议口径是：4xx 中 429 计入，其他 4xx 单独统计但不算 SLO 违约。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>争议二：超时算不算错误。</strong> 客户端超时（比如 1s 未返回）而服务端最终在 3s 返回 200——从服务端看是成功，从用户看是失败。这两个数字的差额就是「用户感知的失败」。衡量它需要在入口处按客户端超时阈值截断计算，也就是「在 X 毫秒内未返回的比例」。这个指标比传统错误率更贴近体验，也与 <a href=\"../client-experience-metrics/\">客户端与体验指标</a> 一章的口径衔接。</p>\n<p><strong>争议三：降级成功算不算成功。</strong> 这是最容易被忽视的。当主链路故障时，服务返回降级结果（空列表、缓存副本、默认排序）并标记 200——监控上错误率为 0，可用性 100%，但实际上用户拿到的是低质量结果。<strong>降级必须被单独计量，且必须计入 SLO。</strong> 工程上可行的做法是：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在响应中设置可观测的降级标记（如自定义 header 或指标标签 <code>degraded=&quot;true&quot;</code>）；</li>\n<li>把「降级返回比例」作为一个独立的 SLI 与 SLO，而不是把它折叠进成功率；</li>\n<li>在错误预算计算中，降级请求按一定权重折算（比如 0.5 个失败），权重值反映业务上降级的实际损失。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>否则会出现一种荒谬局面：<strong>监控全绿，事故从用户那里得知</strong>。这正是 <a href=\"../cost-freshness-metrics/metric-pitfalls\">指标滥用：平均延迟崇拜与幸存者偏差</a> 讨论的 Goodhart 定律的一个实例——当「成功率」成为考核指标，把失败改名为降级就成了达成指标的最短路径。搜索场景里，降级最常见的形式是「对齐到更少的检索分片」或「跳过精排」，其结果是零结果率上升，这一指标的具体定义见 <a href=\"../client-experience-metrics/correctness-metrics\">成功率、零结果率与功能正确性指标</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从饱和度到容量决策\">从饱和度到容量决策</h2><p>把前三节串起来，可以得到一个可执行的容量决策流程：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>找出瓶颈资源。</strong> 逐资源计算饱和度，取最接近上限的那个。若多个资源饱和度接近，说明需要架构调整而非单纯扩容。</li>\n<li><strong>用延迟目标反推可接受利用率。</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho_{max} = 1 - W_s / W_{target}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W = W_s/(1-\\rho)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 变形）。例如服务时间 50ms、目标 p99 200ms，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>200</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0.75</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho_{max} = 1 - 50/200 = 0.75</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50/200</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.75</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>用峰值流量而非均值做校验。</strong> 峰值 QPS / (<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{max} \\cdot \\rho_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>) 得到所需副本数，向上取整并加冗余。</li>\n<li><strong>设定饱和度告警线。</strong> 告警应在拐点之前触发，因此告警值应显著低于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（常见做法是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的 70–80%）。</li>\n<li><strong>定期用开环压测验证 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda\\_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho\\_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7406em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span> 是否仍然成立。</strong> 代码变更、依赖升级、数据量增长都会让这两个参数漂移。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>第 5 步最容易被跳过，也是最有价值的：<strong>容量参数不是常量，而是会随系统演进而衰减的估计值</strong>。一个季度前测出的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 可能因为一次索引格式变更而下降 30%。定期重测并把结果归档，才能在真正的大促或故障前有可信的容量依据——这也是容量与全链路压测一章的方法论核心。饱和度告警的阈值设定与噪声控制细节属于告警工程一章的主题；本篇只负责给出这些阈值应当依据什么来定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>饱和度是「还能撑多久」的唯一可信来源，因为它先于崩溃发出信号。</li>\n<li>饱和度必须逐资源观测（CPU、内存、磁盘队列、连接池、线程池、下游配额），取最紧的那个作为系统饱和度。</li>\n<li>「CPU 空闲但系统变慢」是饱和度故障的典型指纹，单看 CPU 会完全错过它。</li>\n<li>排队模型给出拐点：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 从 0.8 到 0.95，吞吐涨不到 20%，延迟涨近 5 倍；70% 红线由此而来。</li>\n<li>「可接受利用率」由延迟目标除以服务时间决定，没有普适数值；容器场景必须用 cgroup 限额口径而非节点口径。</li>\n<li>错误率定义有三个争议点：4xx 的归属（429 应计入）、客户端超时的归属、降级成功的归属。</li>\n<li>降级必须被单独计量并计入 SLO，否则会出现「监控全绿、用户先发现故障」的局面。</li>\n<li>容量决策五步：找瓶颈 → 反推可接受利用率 → 用峰值校验 → 设告警线 → 定期重测。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"饱和度与错误率：系统还能撑多久","id":"饱和度与错误率-系统还能撑多久"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"利用率的拐点：为什么 70% 是常见的经验红线","id":"利用率的拐点-为什么-70-是常见的经验红线"},{"level":2,"text":"错误率、成功率与可用性的正确定义","id":"错误率-成功率与可用性的正确定义"},{"level":2,"text":"从饱和度到容量决策","id":"从饱和度到容量决策"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"吞吐量：QPS/RPS/TPS 与并发数的辨析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/core-metrics-map/request-metrics/throughput-units"},"next":{"title":"Core Web Vitals 与搜索场景映射","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/core-metrics-map/client-experience-metrics/core-web-vitals"}}